iable and accurate as you input the  daily price changes turn a profit we'll  let you know which pattern is most  likely for the week it will even give  you a range of prices you can expect to  see I'll definitely be linking this went  down in the description below because  it's an incredibly valuable tool for  mastering the stock market now as for  the fluctuating trend it's pretty  self-explanatory it's mostly random  although the prices usually seem to  range between 40 and 200 bells the  decreasing pattern is by far the worst  your prices will start low and continue  down the entire week but wait didn't I  say early in the video I could guarantee  you won't  your bells that's where number five  comes in if all else fails visit a  friend  your biggest ace in the hole when it  comes to selling turnips is you can sell  them on another island it doesn't have  to be on your own island now even if you  don't have any friends who play Animal  Crossing there are multiple websites out  there dedicated to this there's the AC  turnip subreddit the turnip exchange  subreddit in a turnip exchange website  and many more I'll link those three down  in the description below  hey if all else fails you can always hit  me up on Twitch and check my turnip  prices for the week  I can't wait to hear from you guys how  much you're making with these tips so  let me know down in the comments below  and if you have any questions at all  I'll be happy to answer them that's  gonna be it for today's video I'll talk  to you again soon
 

